Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|User Groups|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Export User Group Members
Priority: 3
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	When User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea1@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn1|
		|userLastName|userln1|
		|userScreenName|usersn1|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea2@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn2|
		|userLastName|userln2|
		|userScreenName|usersn2|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup assign Member CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
		|userScreenName|usersn1|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup assign Member CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
		|userScreenName|usersn2|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	Then LAR export User Groups
		|larFileName|User_Group_Members.lar|
Scenario: User Group Private Page Inheritance
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|layout.user.private.layouts.auto.create=false${line.separator}user.groups.copy.layouts.to.user.personal.site=true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup add Page CP
		|page|Dashboard|
		|pageName|Test User Group Page 1|
		|sitePagePrivacy|Private|
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And Type the value 'userfn' at locator 'NavBar#BASIC_SEARCH_FIELD'
	And Click at locator 'Button#SUBMIT'
	And these variables
		|key_rowEntry|usersn|
	And Click at locator 'ContentRow#ENTRY_CONTENT_ENTRY_ELLIPSIS'
	And AssertClick the value 'Manage Pages' at locator 'MenuItem#MANAGE_PAGES'
	And these variables
		|key_page|Test User Group Page 1|
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'ProductMenu#PAGES'
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup assign Member CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And UserBar goto Dashboard
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Test User Group Page 1' at locator 'Home#PAGE_1'
	And User logout User PG
	Then User login PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
